    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the boy get out of the astral plane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark and mysterious place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and avoid traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing the game you will receive:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a gripping plot and atmosphere. You will be able to explore the dark and mysterious world of the astral plane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- exciting gameplay (puzzles, riddles, manipulation of objects, traps). Puzzles and obstacles will not let you get bored and will require you to think logically and strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- satisfaction from overcoming difficulties and saving the boy (emotional involvement).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, this is an exciting, atmospheric and fascinating game for lovers of puzzles, mysticism and emotional stories.</p>",
